text = "[b]Goal:[/b] Destroy more enemy Crown Towers than your opponent within 3 minutes, or destroy the enemy King Tower for an instant 3-Crown victory!

[b]Elixir:[/b]
• You start with 5 Elixir (Max 10).
• 1x Elixir during the first 2 minutes.
• 2x Elixir in the final 1 minute.
• 3x Elixir during Sudden Death overtime!

[b]Deploying Cards:[/b]
• Click any card in your 4-card hand at the bottom to select it.
• Click within your half of the arena (or extended territory) to deploy.
• Spells like Fireball and Arrows can be placed anywhere on the map!
• Right-click to cancel card placement.

[b]Multiplayer 1v1:[/b]
• One player clicks [b]Host 1v1 Match[/b].
• The second player clicks [b]Join 1v1 Match[/b] (uses localhost 127.0.0.1 for local testing)."

